      "description": "Pulsar Phone connects your Android smartphone with Pulsar OS on your Linux PC.\n\nFeatures:\n* High-speed wireless screen mirroring with ultra-low latency\n* Synchronized stereo audio streaming between PC and phone\n* Remote multi-display desktop view and touch controls\n* Isolated Android application windowing on your PC desktop\n* Automatic zero-configuration network discovery via UDP beacons\n* Bidirectional notification sync and remote control\n",
