      "description": "Sayri Mobile is the Android companion and local orchestrator for Pulsar OS.\n\nFeatures:\n* Full Android system orchestration & dynamic application discovery\n* App Functions and App Intents integration (messaging, sharing, media, alarms)\n* Spatial OCR screen perception and Circle to Search gestures\n* Local streaming voice dictation powered by Dicio\n* Dual-device control (manage both your Android smartphone and your Linux PC)\n* Seamless zero-configuration network pairing with PIN verification\n* Markdown rendering, clipboard copy, and voice responses\n",
